# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit .env.local.

# --- Public, by design -------------------------------------------------
# Both ship in the browser bundle. The anon key is public and RLS is what
# actually protects the data. The service_role key must NEVER appear in
# this project.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- A REAL SECRET -----------------------------------------------------
# Server-side only. It has no NEXT_PUBLIC prefix and must never get one:
# that prefix is what puts a value in the browser bundle. The browser only
# ever calls this app's own /api/ai routes, which verify org membership and
# the daily caps before calling Gemini.
#
# In Vercel add it as a SECRET-type environment variable, then REDEPLOY -
# Vercel does not apply new env vars to an existing build.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Overridable so a model RETIREMENT is a config change rather
# than a code change - Google retires these on its own schedule and the
# API answers 404 naming the replacement. Defaults to gemini-3.6-flash.
GEMINI_MODEL=
